      "role": "user",
      "content": "the fire in the hearth is almost out. just ash and cold stone now. everything i built... the banners, the oaths, the people... it's all just dust under my boots. i look at my sword and i don't even see a weapon anymore. i just see a heavy, silent thing that's outlived its purpose. there aren't any more quests, no more dragons to slay. just this endless, grey silence. it feels like the story has reached its final page and there's nothing left to write.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
